### Puzzle rules

- Matching three gems gives basic points.
- Matching four creates a rocket.
- Matching five creates a rainbow gem.
- L-shaped or T-shaped matches create a bomb.
- Special combinations generate additional effects.
- Cascading matches award bonus points.

The game must validate every move.

If a move produces no match, return the gems to their original positions.

If no possible moves remain on the board, automatically shuffle the board.

Ensure that the board always has at least one valid move.

### Puzzle victory

When the player reaches the target score within the available moves:

- Stop the puzzle.
- Show a victory animation.
- Transition back to the treasure chamber.
- Play a chest-unlocking animation.
- Open the treasure chest.

### Puzzle failure

