# PART 6: POWER-UPS AND BOOSTERS

Create two separate categories.

## Running power-ups

**Coin Magnet:** Automatically attracts nearby coins for a limited time.

**Shield:** Protects the character from one obstacle collision.

**Speed Boost:** Temporarily increases running speed and allows the character to pass through certain obstacles.

**Double Coins:** Doubles the coins collected for a limited duration.

**Revive:** Allows the player to continue after one fatal collision, if available.

## Puzzle boosters

**Hammer:** Removes one selected gem.

**Shuffle:** Rearranges the puzzle board.

**Extra Moves:** Adds five additional moves.

**Rainbow Gem:** Clears one selected gem colour.

**Bomb:** Clears a surrounding group of gems.

All boosters must have working effects.

The player can earn boosters through gameplay or unlock them using in-game currency.

